@startuml
title Requirements Lifecycle

start
:Identify stakeholder needs;
:Analyze scope, constraints, and risks;
:Define functional and non-functional requirements;
:Define integrations, security, and privacy requirements;
:Write user stories and use cases;
:Define acceptance criteria;
:Build requirements traceability matrix;

repeat
  :Review and validate requirements;
  if (Approved?) then (yes)
    break
  else (no)
    :Revise requirements;
    :Update related requirements artifacts;
    :Update requirements traceability matrix;
  endif
repeat while (Validation required?) is (yes)

:Baseline requirements;
stop
@enduml